  "expGermanCastlesDesc": "Double-size German castle tiles. The castle lord scores 12 pts for a completed castle, and each castle at the end of a completed road or city gives the majority players 3 extra pts.",
  "expGermanCathedrals": "Cathedrals in Germany",
  "expGermanCathedralsDesc": "Tiles with German cathedrals in the fields. A highwayman on a road to a cathedral gets double points per road segment, even for a road left unfinished at the end of the game, and the archbishop 1 pt per road segment, but only when all the roads are closed.",
