  "germanCastlesAtFeatureHint": "Set the number of German castles at the ends of the completed feature: for each one the majority players get {points} extra pts, whether or not the castle is occupied. The bonus is added after the cathedral and inn modifiers. A road that starts and ends on the same castle counts it once.",
  "roadToCathedral": "Leads to a cathedral",
